# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PTRTS 桌宠 —— .gitattributes（★ 1.9.2 建立）
#
# 目的：统一换行符，消掉 git 每次 add 都刷的
#   "LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it" 警告。
#   `text=auto` = 仓库里统一存 LF，检出到 Windows 工作区时自动转 CRLF。
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

* text=auto

# 文本类：明确按文本处理（避免中文 txt 被当二进制）
*.py    text
*.txt   text
*.md    text
*.json  text
*.yml   text
*.yaml  text
*.html  text
*.css   text
*.js    text
*.ps1   text
*.bat   text

# 二进制类：别做换行转换
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.db    binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.bin   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.zip   binary
